<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Robot YAW · PITCH · ROLL 3D - Gắp táo bỏ hộp giấy</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#090e1d;--panel:#0e1527;--card:#141d35;--card2:#1b2744;--line:rgba(255,255,255,.08);--tx:#eef1fb;--mu:#8f9bc2;
--pink:#E4005A;--amber:#FFB000;--purple:#7A2A8C;--teal:#00A19B;--sky:#3AAFE3;--ok:#34d399;--bad:#fb7185}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%;margin:0}
body{font-family:'Inter',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx);
display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 410px;overflow:hidden;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
#stage{position:relative;min-width:0;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}
canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none;cursor:default;outline:none}
canvas.hot{cursor:grab}
canvas.drag{cursor:grabbing}
.hud{position:absolute;left:16px;top:16px;width:300px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:18px;background:rgba(12,18,38,.72);
backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35);pointer-events:none}
.hud-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px}
.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ok);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(52,211,153,.18);animation:pulse 1.8s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 7px rgba(52,211,153,.05)}}
.chip{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);color:var(--mu);border:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap}
.chip.ok{background:rgba(52,211,153,.16);color:var(--ok);border-color:rgba(52,211,153,.4)}
.chip.bad{background:rgba(251,113,133,.14);color:var(--bad);border-color:rgba(251,113,133,.4)}
.chip.run{background:rgba(58,175,227,.16);color:var(--sky);border-color:rgba(58,175,227,.4)}
.hint{margin:10px 0 10px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#cfd6f1;min-height:38px}
.meter{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.meter-bar{position:relative;flex:1;height:8px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:visible}
.meter-bar i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:0;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--pink),var(--amber));transition:width .12s,background .2s}
.meter-bar i.ok{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--teal),var(--ok))}
.meter-bar u{position:absolute;left:67%;top:-3px;bottom:-3px;width:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);border-radius:2px}
.meter span{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;width:38px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.meter-label{margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--mu)}
.toast{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:22px;transform:translate(-50%,20px);opacity:0;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;
background:rgba(251,113,133,.95);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.4);transition:.25s;pointer-events:none;max-width:90%;text-align:center}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
.banner{position:absolute;inset:0;display:none;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding-top:24%;pointer-events:none}
.banner.show{display:flex}
.banner .card{pointer-events:auto;text-align:center;padding:22px 34px 24px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,161,155,.96),rgba(58,175,227,.96));
box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.25) inset;animation:pop .5s cubic-bezier(.2,1.4,.4,1)}
.banner .big{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.3px}
.banner p{margin:6px 0 14px;font-size:13px;color:#e6fbff}
@keyframes pop{from{transform:scale(.6);opacity:0}}
#panel{background:var(--panel);border-left:1px solid var(--line);overflow-y:auto;padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.brand img{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;padding:3px;object-fit:contain;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
.brand h1{margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--sky),#c27be0,var(--pink));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.brand p{margin:2px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--mu)}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:14px 14px 15px}
.card h3{margin:0 0 11px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mu);font-weight:700}
.prog{height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px}
.prog i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--pink),var(--amber),var(--ok));transition:width .4s}
.steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mu);transition:.2s}
.step b{flex:none;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.step.active{color:var(--tx)}
.step.active b{background:var(--amber);color:#2b1c00;border-color:transparent;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(255,176,0,.18)}
.step.done{color:var(--ok)}
.step.done b{background:var(--ok);color:#052e1f;border-color:transparent}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}
.btn{font:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:var(--tx);border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card2);padding:11px 12px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;width:100%}
.btn:hover:not(:disabled){filter:brightness(1.18);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(0)}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.42;cursor:not-allowed}
.btn.go{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--teal),var(--sky));border-color:transparent;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,161,155,.28);font-size:14px;padding:13px}
.btn.drop{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--amber),#ff7a1a);border-color:transparent;color:#2b1500;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(255,150,0,.28);font-size:14px;padding:13px}
.btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pink),var(--purple));border-color:transparent;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(228,0,90,.28)}
.btn.sm{font-size:12px;padding:9px 8px;font-weight:600}
.stack{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;padding:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
.tabs button{flex:1;font:inherit;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:8px;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:transparent;color:var(--mu);cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}
.tabs button.on{background:var(--card2);color:var(--tx);box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
.sl{margin-bottom:13px}.sl:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.sl div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#cfd6f1}
.sl b{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
input[type=range]{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:20px;background:transparent;margin:0;cursor:pointer}
input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track{height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
input[type=range]::-moz-range-track{height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:18px;height:18px;margin-top:-6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c,#fff);border:3px solid #0e1527;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--c,#fff),0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
input[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c,#fff);border:3px solid #0e1527;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--c,#fff)}
.hidden{display:none!important}
.reach{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:11px;font-size:12px;color:var(--mu)}
.rbar{flex:1;height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:hidden}
.rbar i{display:block;height:100%;width:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--amber),var(--sky));transition:width .5s cubic-bezier(.3,.7,.2,1)}
.reach b{color:var(--tx);min-width:38px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tabs button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
.tip{font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--mu)}
.tip b{color:var(--tx)}
.tip kbd{font:inherit;font-size:11px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--tx)}
@media (max-width:900px){
body{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:58vh auto;overflow:auto;height:auto;min-height:100%}
#stage{height:58vh}#panel{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);overflow:visible}
.hud{width:min(270px,calc(100% - 32px));padding:11px 13px}.hint{font-size:12px;min-height:0}
}

.views{position:absolute;right:14px;top:14px;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end;max-width:calc(100% - 340px)}
.vb{font:inherit;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(12,18,38,.72);color:#cfd6f1;cursor:pointer;
backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);transition:.15s;white-space:nowrap}
.vb:hover{filter:brightness(1.25)}
.vb.on{background:rgba(58,175,227,.22);border-color:rgba(58,175,227,.55);color:#fff}
.vb.tg.on{background:rgba(255,176,0,.18);border-color:rgba(255,176,0,.5)}
.vsep{width:1px;height:18px;background:var(--line);margin:0 2px}
.space{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:11px;font-size:12px;color:var(--mu)}
.space b{color:var(--tx);font-weight:700;text-align:right}
.space b.p2{color:var(--amber)}.space b.p3{color:var(--sky)}
.axes{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:9px;font-size:11px;color:var(--mu);flex-wrap:wrap}
.axes span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.axes i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block}
.pills{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
.pill{--c:#fff;--cs:rgba(255,255,255,.14);font:inherit;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:8px 15px;border-radius:99px;border:1.6px solid var(--c);background:transparent;color:var(--c);cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;white-space:nowrap}
.pill i{font-style:normal;opacity:.7;margin:0 1px}
.pill:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--cs)}
.pill.on{background:var(--c);color:#0a1024;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px var(--cs)}
.pill:disabled{opacity:.42;cursor:not-allowed;border-style:dashed}
.jnote{margin-top:10px;min-height:56px}
.sl.lock{opacity:.45}
.sl.sel{background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(255,255,255,.045);border-radius:8px}
.sl span i{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:7px}
.ikinfo{margin-top:12px;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--line)}
@media (max-width:900px){.views{max-width:calc(100% - 28px);top:auto;bottom:12px;right:12px;left:12px;justify-content:center}.toast{bottom:62px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="stage">
  <canvas id="cv"></canvas>
  <div class="hud">
    <div class="hud-top"><span class="dot"></span><b>Gắp táo bỏ hộp</b><span id="modeChip" class="chip">Thủ công</span></div>
    <div id="hint" class="hint">Đưa kẹp lại gần quả táo.</div>
    <div class="meter"><div class="meter-bar"><i id="fitBar"></i><u></u></div><span id="fitPct">0%</span></div>
    <div class="meter-label">Độ khớp giữa hai ngón kẹp và quả táo</div>
  </div>
  <div class="views">
    <button class="vb on" data-v="persp">Góc 3D</button><button class="vb" data-v="front">Nhìn trước</button><button class="vb" data-v="top">Nhìn từ trên</button>
    <span class="vsep"></span><button id="btnReach" class="vb tg on">Vùng với tới</button>
  </div>
  <div id="toast" class="toast"></div>
  <div id="banner" class="banner"><div class="card"><div class="big">🎉 Hoàn thành nhiệm vụ!</div><p>Quả táo đã nằm gọn trong hộp.</p><button id="btnAgain" class="btn primary">Chơi lại</button></div></div>
</div>

<aside id="panel">
  <div class="brand"><img id="logoImg" alt="logo" src="data:image/png;base64,"><div><h1 id="brandTitle">Robot 3 DoF · Gắp táo 3D</h1><p>Yaw · Pitch · Roll · động học thuận / ngược</p></div></div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Số bậc tự do (DoF)</h3>
    <div class="tabs" style="margin-bottom:10px"><button id="dof2">2 DoF</button><button id="dof3" class="on">3 DoF</button></div>
    <div id="dofDesc" class="tip"></div>
    <div class="pills" id="pills">
      <button class="pill" data-j="yaw" style="--c:#3aafe3;--cs:rgba(58,175,227,.2)">YAW <i>·</i> Z</button>
      <button class="pill" data-j="pitch" style="--c:#a78bfa;--cs:rgba(167,139,250,.2)">PITCH <i>·</i> Y</button>
      <button class="pill" data-j="roll" style="--c:#ff4d6d;--cs:rgba(255,77,109,.2)">ROLL <i>·</i> X</button>
    </div>
    <div id="jointNote" class="tip jnote"></div>
    <div class="space"><span>Không gian làm việc</span><b id="spaceTxt">Mặt cầu r = 230</b></div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Nhiệm vụ</h3>
    <div class="prog"><i id="prog"></i></div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step" id="st1"><b>1</b>Đưa quả táo vào giữa hai ngón kẹp</div>
      <div class="step" id="st2"><b>2</b>Gắp trọn quả táo</div>
      <div class="step" id="st3"><b>3</b>Mang tới hộp và thả vào trong</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Kẹp gắp</h3>
    <div class="stack">
      <button id="btnGrip" class="btn go" disabled>GẮP QUẢ TÁO</button>
      <div class="row"><button id="btnReset" class="btn sm">↺ Làm lại nhiệm vụ</button><button id="btnRandom" class="btn sm">🎲 Đổi vị trí táo</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Cánh tay tự động</h3>
    <div class="stack">
      <button id="btnAuto" class="btn primary">▶ Tự động gắp &amp; thả</button>
      <button id="btnStop" class="btn hidden">■ Dừng lại</button>
      <div class="row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr">
        <button id="btnToApple" class="btn sm">Tới táo</button>
        <button id="btnToBin" class="btn sm">Tới hộp</button>
        <button id="btnHome" class="btn sm">Tư thế nghỉ</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="tabs"><button id="tabFK" class="on">Góc khớp</button><button id="tabIK">Tọa độ kẹp</button></div>
    <div id="panelFK">
      <div class="sl" id="r1"><div><span id="l1"><i style="background:#3aafe3"></i>YAW · Z · xoay đế</span><b id="v1">0°</b></div><input type="range" id="s1" min="-180" max="180" step="1" style="--c:#3aafe3"></div>
      <div class="sl" id="r2"><div><span id="l2"><i style="background:#a78bfa"></i>PITCH · Y · nâng / hạ</span><b id="v2">0°</b></div><input type="range" id="s2" min="-30" max="90" step="1" style="--c:#a78bfa"></div>
      <div class="sl" id="r3"><div><span id="l3"><i style="background:#ff4d6d"></i>ROLL · X · xoay kẹp</span><b id="v3">0°</b></div><input type="range" id="s3" min="-180" max="180" step="1" style="--c:#ff4d6d"></div>
    </div>
    <div id="panelIK" class="hidden">
      <div class="sl"><div><span>Điểm đích X</span><b id="vx">0</b></div><input type="range" id="sx" min="-300" max="300" step="1" style="--c:#ff4d6d"></div>
      <div class="sl"><div><span>Điểm đích Y (cao)</span><b id="vy">0</b></div><input type="range" id="sy" min="0" max="360" step="1" style="--c:#3aafe3"></div>
      <div class="sl" id="rz"><div><span>Điểm đích Z</span><b id="vz">0</b></div><input type="range" id="sz" min="-300" max="300" step="1" style="--c:#a78bfa"></div>
      <div id="ikInfo" class="tip ikinfo"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Kéo tay nắm bằng chuột</h3>
    <div id="dragNote" class="tip"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="card tip">
    <b>Mẹo:</b> kéo <b>vòng tròn trắng</b> ở đầu kẹp: nó trượt trên mặt cầu. Bấm một nút <b>YAW·Z / PITCH·Y / ROLL·X</b> để xem trục của khớp đó và chỉ kéo riêng khớp ấy; kéo vào chỗ trống để xoay góc nhìn, cuộn chuột để phóng to.
    Táo phải nằm trên <b>vòng vàng</b> dưới sàn thì kẹp mới chạm tới. Kẹp ôm <b>cả quả táo</b>: chỉ cần táo nằm gọn giữa hai ngón (vòng nét đứt chuyển xanh).
    Phím <kbd>Space</kbd> gắp / thả, <kbd>R</kbd> làm lại, <kbd>2</kbd> / <kbd>3</kbd> đổi số DoF, <kbd>Esc</kbd> bỏ chọn khớp.
  </div>
